# Allowlist, not a denylist.
#
# This repo's root is ~/.config, which is where many CLI tools store
# credentials in plaintext (gh/hosts.yml, gcloud/credentials.db,
# configstore/*.json, ...). A denylist would require remembering to exclude
# every tool installed from now on — forever, correctly.
#
# So: ignore everything at the top level, then opt in explicitly below.
# Anything a new tool drops into ~/.config is invisible to git by default.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/aerospace/
!/macos/
!/cheatsheet.md

# Never, anywhere — these can appear inside allowed directories too.
.DS_Store
*.log
*.swp
